        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "9 months ago",
        "text": "I visited this garage on a Saturday during an unexpected issue with my vehicle, and I was extremely impressed by the level of service provided. Despite the short notice, they promptly assessed and completed the necessary repairs the same day. As a family-run business, they offer a welcoming and personal touch that sets them apart. The staff were not only courteous and approachable but also demonstrated a high level of professionalism and technical expertise. They took the time to clearly explain the issues with the vehicle and the work that needed to be done. I will definitely return for future servicing and highly recommend their services to anyone in need of reliable automotive care.",
